<view class="page" style="--font-scale: {{fontScale}}">
  <view class="page-heading">
    <view class="page-heading__main">
      <view class="page-heading__title">一段田间观察</view>
      <view class="page-heading__sub">留住发现，也听听大家的想法。点赞与评论都按幂等处理，重复操作不会重复计数。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <state-view
    wx:if="{{guest}}"
    status="guest"
    desc="社区内容需要登录后查看。"
    action-text="去登录"
    bind:action="onLogin"
  ></state-view>

  <block wx:else>
    <state-view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" status="loading"></state-view>

    <!-- 失败态：`error-code` 交给统一状态层判定。403 三码（SCOPE_DENIED／CONSENT_REQUIRED／
         ACCOUNT_INACTIVE）会被升级成 denied 语气并用本页的「没有权限查看这条内容」标题，
         404 仍走 invalid（内容确实可能已下架/未过审），其余走 error。
         `allow-denied-action` 保留「返回社区」：denied 默认会收起重试类按钮，但**返回导航**
         不是重试，收掉会让用户停在一个回不去的页面里。 -->
    <state-view
      wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}"
      status="{{stateStatus}}"
      error-code="{{errorCode}}"
      title="{{stateTitle}}"
      desc="{{errorText}}"
      action-text="返回社区"
      allow-denied-action="{{true}}"
      bind:action="onBack"
    ></state-view>

    <block wx:else>
      <view class="card">
        <view class="post-author">
          <view class="avatar post-author__avatar">{{post.authorAvatar}}</view>
          <view class="post-author__copy">
            <view class="post-author__title">{{post.author}}</view>
            <view class="post-author__meta">{{post.time}}{{post.crop_id ? ' · ' + post.crop_id : ''}}{{post.region_code ? ' · ' + post.region_code : ''}}</view>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{post.authorAnonymized}}" class="post-author__tag pill pill--gray">已注销</view>
          <view class="post-author__tag pill {{post.stateLabel ? 'pill--amber' : 'pill--gray'}}">{{post.stateLabel || post.publicLabel}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="post-title">{{post.title}}</view>
        <view class="post-text">{{post.body}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{post.linkTitle}}" class="pill">关联资料：{{post.linkTitle}}</view>
        <view wx:elif="{{post.linkState === 'unavailable'}}" class="pill pill--gray">关联资料当前不可用（只保留目标引用）</view>

        <view class="row-actions form-gap">
          <gy-ui-button label="点赞" variant="primary" data-kind="post" bind:tap="onLikePost"></gy-ui-button>
          <gy-ui-button label="取消点赞" variant="ghost" bind:tap="onUnlikePost"></gy-ui-button>
          <gy-ui-button label="反馈问题" variant="ghost" bind:tap="onReportPost"></gy-ui-button>
        </view>
        <view class="demo-caption form-gap">
          契约的内容投影里没有点赞数，也没有「我是否点过赞」的读取口，因此这里不显示点赞数；
          服务端对重复点赞是幂等的（只保留一条记录，不重复计数）。
        </view>
      </view>

      <!-- 仅作者可用的编辑/删除：契约 Author 是假名投影，客户端无法判断归属，
           因此这里不伪造"这是你的内容"，越权一律由服务端 404 拒绝。 -->
      <view class="card">
        <view class="panel-head">
          <view class="panel-head__title">我的内容（仅作者可操作）</view>
          <view class="pill pill--gray">越权将被服务端拒绝</view>
        </view>
        <view class="row-actions">
          <gy-ui-button label="{{editingPost ? '收起编辑' : '编辑本条'}}" variant="ghost" bind:tap="onToggleEditPost"></gy-ui-button>
          <gy-ui-button label="删除本条" variant="danger" bind:tap="onDeletePost"></gy-ui-button>
        </view>
        <block wx:if="{{editingPost}}">
          <view class="label form-gap">标题（1..120）</view>
          <input class="input" value="{{editTitle}}" maxlength="120" bindinput="onEditTitle" />
          <view class="label form-gap">正文（1..8000）</view>
          <textarea class="input textarea" value="{{editBody}}" maxlength="8000" bindinput="onEditBody"></textarea>
          <view class="demo-caption form-gap">保存会生成新版本并重新审核；旧版本的审核结论不会套用到新版本。</view>
          <view class="row-actions form-gap">
            <gy-ui-button label="保存并重新审核" variant="primary" bind:tap="onSavePost"></gy-ui-button>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>

      <!-- 评论 -->
      <view class="card">
        <view class="card-title">交流与讨论</view>

        <!-- 评论段自己的三态：加载中／取数失败（可重试）／真的没有评论。
             取数失败**不得**折叠成「还没有评论」空态（那是在为服务端没回话编一个结论）。 -->
        <state-view wx:if="{{commentsStatus === 'loading'}}" status="loading"></state-view>

        <state-view
          wx:elif="{{commentsStatus === 'error'}}"
          status="error"
          title="评论没有取到"
          desc="{{commentsError}}"
          action-text="重新读取评论"
          bind:action="onRetryComments"
        ></state-view>

        <state-view wx:elif="{{commentsStatus === 'empty'}}" status="empty" title="还没有评论" desc="欢迎留下第一条观察。"></state-view>

        <block wx:for="{{comments}}" wx:key="id">
          <view class="comment-row">
            <view class="avatar comment-row__avatar">{{item.authorAvatar}}</view>
            <view class="comment-row__copy">
              <view class="comment-row__title">{{item.author}} · {{item.time}}</view>
              <view wx:if="{{item.authorAnonymized}}" class="pill pill--gray comment-row__tag">已注销</view>
              <view wx:if="{{item.stateLabel}}" class="pill pill--amber comment-row__tag">{{item.stateLabel}}</view>
              <view class="comment-row__text">{{item.body}}</view>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="row-actions comment-row__actions">
            <gy-ui-button label="点赞" variant="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onLikeComment"></gy-ui-button>
            <gy-ui-button label="取消点赞" variant="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onUnlikeComment"></gy-ui-button>
            <gy-ui-button label="反馈" variant="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onReportComment"></gy-ui-button>
            <gy-ui-button label="编辑" variant="ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onToggleEditComment"></gy-ui-button>
            <gy-ui-button label="删除" variant="danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bind:tap="onDeleteComment"></gy-ui-button>
          </view>
          <block wx:if="{{editingCommentId === item.id}}">
            <textarea class="input textarea" value="{{editCommentText}}" maxlength="4000" bindinput="onEditCommentInput"></textarea>
            <view class="row-actions form-gap">
              <gy-ui-button label="保存并重新审核" variant="primary" bind:tap="onSaveComment"></gy-ui-button>
            </view>
          </block>
        </block>

        <view wx:if="{{nextCursor}}" class="row-actions">
          <gy-ui-button label="加载更多评论" variant="ghost" bind:tap="onLoadMoreComments"></gy-ui-button>
        </view>

        <view class="label form-gap">发表评论（1..4000）</view>
        <textarea class="input textarea" value="{{commentText}}" maxlength="4000" placeholder="分享你的观察…" bindinput="onCommentInput"></textarea>
        <view class="row-actions form-gap">
          <gy-ui-button label="{{submitting ? '正在提交…' : '发送评论'}}" variant="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bind:tap="onSubmitComment"></gy-ui-button>
          <gy-ui-button label="返回社区" variant="ghost" bind:tap="onBack"></gy-ui-button>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="demo-caption">{{modeNote}}</view>
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
